WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.012
AI-assisted secure code review is the use
of an AI system to support an authorized

2
00:00:06.092 --> 00:00:09.335
review of source code for security
weaknesses.

3
00:00:09.415 --> 00:00:11.522
The important word is support.

4
00:00:11.602 --> 00:00:15.656
The AI can explain unfamiliar code,
summarize a component,

5
00:00:15.736 --> 00:00:19.059
suggest likely review areas, draft
checklists,

6
00:00:19.139 --> 00:00:22.787
compare code against common secure coding
patterns,

7
00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:27.893
and help turn verified observations into
clearer remediation language.

8
00:00:27.973 --> 00:00:31.378
It can make a reviewer faster and more
consistent,

9
00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:35.105
especially when the codebase is large or
unfamiliar.

10
00:00:35.185 --> 00:00:37.050
The AI is not the authority.

11
00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:40.778
A model does not know the organization
risk appetite,

12
00:00:40.858 --> 00:00:45.397
the real deployment environment, the
production configuration,

13
00:00:45.477 --> 00:00:51.071
the business rules, or the history behind
a design decision unless that context is

14
00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.691
provided and checked.

15
00:00:52.771 --> 00:00:54.716
It may find a useful pattern,

16
00:00:54.796 --> 00:00:59.822
but it may also miss a serious issue or
describe a vulnerability that is not

17
00:00:59.902 --> 00:01:00.551
present.

18
00:01:00.631 --> 00:01:04.684
Treat every AI statement as a lead that
needs verification,

19
00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:06.547
not as a finished finding.

20
00:01:06.627 --> 00:01:12.059
A professional AI-assisted review still
depends on human judgment, evidence,

21
00:01:12.139 --> 00:01:13.598
and accountability.

22
00:01:13.678 --> 00:01:17.488
The reviewer defines scope, protects code
and secrets,

23
00:01:17.568 --> 00:01:21.621
asks focused questions, checks claims
against the source,

24
00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:24.052
and records why a finding is valid.

25
00:01:24.132 --> 00:01:29.076
A security issue becomes a finding when it
is supported by code evidence,

26
00:01:29.156 --> 00:01:32.723
context, impact, and a practical
remediation path.

27
00:01:32.803 --> 00:01:35.640
The product is not automated confidence.

28
00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:40.260
The product is better security reasoning
with a faster assistant.
